{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23480","headline":"重题别东楼 · 白居易","name":"重题别东楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东楼胜事我偏知，气象多随昏旦移。\n湖卷衣裳白重叠，山张屏障绿参差。\n海仙楼塔晴方出，江女笙箫夜始吹。\n春雨星攒寻蟹火，秋风霞颭弄涛旗。\n宴宜云髻新梳後，曲爱霓裳未拍时。\n太守三年嘲不尽，郡斋空作百篇诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}